The CAD model is the pinned Seeed B601-DM DevArm from
[reBot-DevArm|https://github.com/Seeed-Projects/reBot-DevArm], revision
`922c5fa3d8c8919db1847b49166f02fc26c8fdad`, CERN-OHL-W-2.0.
The complete program downloads/verifies missing assets through the native
catalog. The initial vision checkpoint is supplied with the archived episodic
example. Results concern procedural CAD fruit and a calibrated workcell;
rotation stabilization, ideal grasping, kinematic servos and limited collision
geometry remain approximations rather than a hardware-transfer demonstration.
